<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Base - + Time in the drops</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Target 55g carbs/hr. Practice this prescription.

Warm up, building from Z1 to Z2; keep cadence over 85 rpm
-
Steady Z2 for ~210min depending on time allowed. Use the entire zone - don't just ride the top of it; keep cadence 85-95 throughout.
-
Cool down.

RPE guide: 66% FTP -> RPE 3</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <SteadyState Duration="12600" Power="0.66"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>